A profile selected by name that grants no write. Resolving it rather than
guessing from the name is what keeps this rule off every configuration that
happens to name a profile.

>>> .codex/config.toml
approval_policy = "never"
default_permissions = "ours"

[permissions.ours]
extends = ":read-only"

[permissions.ours.filesystem]
"/srv" = "read"
